OL,4,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GCrackazat takes over the Trunk of
OL,7,     GFunk this week. He's spent years
OL,8,     Gcarving out a sound that sits
OL,9,     Gsomewhere between jazz, soul,
OL,10,     Ghouse and broken beat.
